# Supply-chain cooldown: refuse any version published less than 7 days ago.
# Hijacked publishes (the March 2026 axios compromise, 1.14.1 / 0.30.4) are
# almost always caught and unpublished within hours, so a cooldown means we are
# never the first to install a malicious release. Requires npm >= 11.10.0.
#
# Applies when resolving new versions (`npm install`, `npm update`). `npm ci` —
# what the Dockerfile and CI run — installs exactly what package-lock.json
# pins, so it is unaffected. For an urgent patch younger than this:
#   npm install <pkg>@<version> --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=7
